.TH "4ksrc-pack1" "6" "2026-11-13" "4k source compo pack User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
4ksrc-pack1-3d, 4ksrc-pack1-hogwagen, 4ksrc-pack1-dwitvs,
4ksrc-pack1-randomname - entries of the 2003 #demoscene 4k source compo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]4ksrc-pack1-3d\f[R]
.PP
\f[B]4ksrc-pack1-hogwagen\f[R]
.PP
\f[B]4ksrc-pack1-dwitvs\f[R] [\f[B]-f\f[R] | \f[B]--fullscreen\f[R]]
.PP
\f[B]4ksrc-pack1-randomname\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The first #demoscene 4k source compo was organized in March 2003 by the
regulars of the #demoscene IRC channel.
Unlike usual 4k compos, the 4 KB limit applied to the C source code of
the entries, not to the executable.
This package contains the four entries, in their final ranking:
.TP
\f[B]4ksrc-pack1-3d\f[R]
\[lq]3d\[rq] by Jylam, winner of the compo (7 votes out of 15): textured
voxel particles, plasma, noise, rasters, zoom, sinus bars and a sinus
scroll, with generated sound.
SDL, 400x300 window.
.TP
\f[B]4ksrc-pack1-hogwagen\f[R]
\[lq]Lollipop hogwagen\[rq] by tonic (5 votes): a tunnel effect with a
music-like noise based on a composition by Tense.
SDL, 400x300 window.
.TP
\f[B]4ksrc-pack1-dwitvs\f[R]
\[lq]different wavelengths in the visible spectrum\[rq] by spectre/flare
(2 votes): one minute of colour grids, rotozoom and wobbling logo.
SDL, 400x300 window.
.TP
\f[B]4ksrc-pack1-randomname\f[R]
\[lq]oh the nos!
its termos and styx\[cq] code!\[rq] by termos and styx (1 vote): a
textured, blended icosahedron.
OpenGL and GLUT, fullscreen.
.PP
\[lq]3d\[rq] and dwitvs advance their animation by a fixed step at each
frame: the Debian package limits them to 60 frames per second so that
they keep their original speed on current hardware.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]-f\f[R], \f[B]--fullscreen\f[R]
(4ksrc-pack1-dwitvs only) run in fullscreen.
.PP
The other programs have no options.
.SH KEYS
.PP
Any key quits the intros.
\[lq]3d\[rq] and dwitvs also stop by themselves at the end of their last
scene.
Closing the window does not quit the SDL entries: press a key instead.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://320x200.org/2003/4k/
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=50507
.SH BUGS
